implemented:
- GlyphAtlasBitmapRenderSubmissionReport aggregates source/allocation/failure counts.
- Report aggregates dirty pages, rebuilt pages, full/partial upload counts and upload bytes.
- Report aggregates draw batch count, pipeline count, gpu batch count, draw commands and vertices.
- has_upload_work, has_gpu_work and has_failures expose renderer-facing readiness checks.

covered scenarios:
- visible mixed AlphaMask/SubpixelMask glyphs: upload+gpu+background composite work.
- clipped glyph: upload remains present while GPU draw work is zero.
- full-page dirty glyph: full upload count increments and byte count is 256.
- invalid Sdf/Oversized bitmap sources: diagnostics remain while upload/GPU work stays zero.

